
 Load-store SASS instructions are per thread instructions (as are all SASS instructions)

 STG.E.S32 [R4+0x8], R7

 "E" is a modifier. Here is the lay of the land for modifiers as described by ChatGPT (literally copied from ChatGPT output)

Summary of Modifiers for LDG and STR
Instruction	Modifier	Purpose
LDG	.E	Bypasses L1 cache, uses L2 cache.
LDG	.L	Uses L1 cache for the load.
LDG	.TEX	Fetches data from global memory using texture fetch semantics.
LDG	.R	Specifies a read-only load, optimized for read-only memory regions.
STR	.E	Stores to global memory via L2 cache, bypassing L1 cache.
STR	.L	Stores to global memory, prioritizing L1 cache.
STR	.TEX	Stores data using texture semantics.
STR	.R	Store data to read-only memory regions.
